<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Heal</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 30)
Mana: 25
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast heal &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast heal</a>   (on yourself)
</pre>
<p>The great healing spell: it gives back a large part of the target's lost hit 
points, many times what the cure spells do, and even mortal wounds close. The 
better your divine sphere, the more it heals.
</p><p>It works on humanoids and mammals, and always on yourself. You can cast it 
while fighting, and it is also found on scrolls, potions and staffs.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cure Light Wounds</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cure Serious Wounds</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Aid</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Divine Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>